cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Structure of the Discretized Complete Blood Count Profile Space: analysis code and aggregate data"
abstract: >-
  Pipeline that maps complete blood count records into a space of qualitative
  profiles (each analyte discretized into five ordinal states relative to its own
  reference interval) and measures the structure of that space: concentration,
  coverage, algebraic redundancy, saturation and geometry. Includes the aggregate
  profile distribution underlying the accompanying manuscript.
